.THS Rnews 8L News.SH NAMERnews - Receive batched Articles from remote System.SH SYNOPSISrnews [-d=<dbglvl>] [<file>].SH DESCRIPTION.ti +3Rnews is called by a remote system to unpack the received news articleand feed them to Inews.  If Inews failed for any reasons, rnews willstore this article in.B /h0/SPOOL/RNEWS(or whereever set using Sysinfo)..SH FILES.O /h0/SPOOL/RNEWSStore failed article there..NO /h0/SPOOL/UUCP/.LOG/rnews.logThe logfile, will only be written if existing..EO.SH SYSINFO.O RNEWS.DIR,s=/h0/SPOOL/RNEWSSets the directory where failed article should be placed.EO.SH SEE ALSO Inews - in this distribution Sbatch - in this distribution